---
id: install-help
title: install
---

install ```sh nuts``` package <nuts-artifact>

##) SYNOPSIS:

    ```sh nuts install <-options> <nuts-artifact>...```

##) OPTIONS:

    ```sh -c | --companions```
        include companions in the install process

    ```sh -i | --installed```
        include already installed artifacts in the install process (re-install)

    ```sh --reinstall```
        force reinstalling the package even if already installed

    ```sh --deploy-only```
        deploy package to local repository without executing install logic

    ```sh --repair```
        repair corrupted installation

    ```sh -g | --args <args> ...```
        pass the given args to the install executor

```!include classpath:/net/thevpc/nuts/runtime/includes/standard-command.ntf```

##) EXAMPLES:

    ```sh nuts install --help```
        show this help and exit

    ```sh nuts install netbeans-launcher```
        install netbeans-launcher

    ```sh nuts --debug -Zy -w test install pnote```
        install pnote in debug mode

    ```sh nuts -Zyb -w test --verbose install netbeans-launcher```
        install netbeans-launcher in verbose mode
